  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three capacitances, each of 3 <math> <mrow> <mi>&#956;</mi> <mtext>F</mtext> </mrow> </math>,&nbsp;are provided. These cannot be combined to provide the resultant capacitance of :</p>",
